# Fast landing pages (must)

Triggers: `/think`, “fast landing”, “jaldi landing”, new route from screenshots/Figma.

## Do this order

1. Read `.cursor/skills/think/SKILL.md`
2. Run **`landing-bootstrap.mdc`** (config, shell, favicon, SEO stubs)
3. Fill / confirm `project.mdc` + `naturavive-brand.mdc` (ask once if empty)
4. Skim **`landing-known-issues.mdc`** + **`header-nav.mdc`** + **`hydration-safe.mdc`**
5. Assets → `@/config/brand`; copy → `src/data/<page>.ts`
6. Thin `page.tsx`; **one section at a time**; gate with `section-build-gate.mdc`
7. Cutout scenes → `layered-scene.mdc`
8. Do not clone another landing’s layout (`per-landing-ui.mdc`)
9. Ship only when: responsive + **404** + **scroll chrome** + **favicon (transparent)** + **SEO** + **fast loading** + `npm run build`

